<nav class="mapleQuick" aria-label="EverLeaf quick links"><div class="wrap"><a href="/downloads"><b class="mapleQuickIcon"><img src="/assets/ui/launcher.svg" alt=""></b><span><strong>Download</strong><small>Launcher & client</small></span></a><a href="/rankings"><b class="mapleQuickIcon"><img src="/assets/ui/trophy.svg" alt=""></b><span><strong>Rankings</strong><small>Top adventurers</small></span></a><a href="/wiki"><b class="mapleQuickIcon"><img src="/assets/ui/journal.svg" alt=""></b><span><strong>Wiki</strong><small>Game knowledge</small></span></a><a href="<%=brand.discordUrl%>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><b class="mapleQuickIcon"><img src="/assets/ui/community.svg" alt=""></b><span><strong>Community</strong><small>Guilds & Discord</small></span></a><a href="<%=sessionPlayer?'/account':'/login'%>"><b class="mapleQuickIcon"><img src="/assets/ui/account.svg" alt=""></b><span><strong><%=sessionPlayer?'My Account':'Account'%></strong><small><%=sessionPlayer?'Characters & settings':'Login or register'%></small></span></a></div></nav>
<section class="mapleHomeBody"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionHead"><div><div class="pageEyebrow">EVERLEAF HANDBOOK</div><h2>Old-school foundations. Better long-term play.</h2></div><a href="/wiki">OPEN THE WIKI →</a></div><div class="mapleIntro homeFeatureGrid"><a class="mapleIntroCard" href="/wiki"><b>v83</b><h3>Enhanced Classic</h3><p>Familiar classes, maps, bosses, quests, items, and progression remain recognizable while carefully chosen systems make the journey smoother.</p></a><a class="mapleIntroCard" href="/downloads"><b>QOL</b><h3>Modern Client Experience</h3><p>The EverLeaf launcher installs, verifies, repairs, updates, and starts your client so players do not have to maintain files by hand.</p></a><a class="mapleIntroCard" href="/rules"><b>FAIR</b><h3>Play Comes First</h3><p>No pay-to-win advantage and no mandatory HP washing. Your character grows through the game, not through a checkout screen.</p></a></div>
